# Build context for every image built from the repository root.
#
# Host build and cache artefacts must never reach an image. `COPY
# services/bb84-kme/app/ ./app/` once carried a host __pycache__ whose .pyc had
# the same size and mtime second as the source it was compiled from, so Python
# took it as current and the KME ran bytecode older than its own source.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[co]
**/node_modules
.venv
# The context is sent to the Docker daemon; nothing built here needs the keys.
.env
